---
layout: base.njk
title: Writing
permalink: /blog/
---
<p class="section-label">Writing</p>
<h1 class="page-title">What to do about supply chain risk.</h1>
<p class="writing-intro">Design choices can limit how a business responds to a shortage. These essays examine what can be done before and after that happens.</p>
<div class="note-list">
  {% for post in collections.posts %}
  <a class="note-item" href="{{ post.url }}">
    <div class="note-item-top">
      <span class="note-title">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
      <span class="note-date">{{ post.data.date | readableDate }}</span>
    </div>
    <p class="note-excerpt">{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>
    {% if post.data.tags %}
    <div class="note-tags">
      {% for tag in post.data.tags %}<span class="tag">{{ tag }}</span>{% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </a>
  {% else %}
  <p style="color:var(--ink-soft);">
    Nothing published yet. This will fill up with short "garden" notes as well as longer
    posts — mostly on product management, supply chain risk, and things I'm learning.
  </p>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
